{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyter/jupyter_client/pulls/1145","id":4677644981,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAgGDR88AAAABFs8ytQ","html_url":"https://github.com/jupyter/jupyter_client/pull/1145","diff_url":"https://github.com/jupyter/jupyter_client/pull/1145.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/jupyter/jupyter_client/pull/1145.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyter/jupyter_client/issues/1145","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyter/jupyter_client/pulls/1145/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyter/jupyter_client/pulls/1145/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyter/jupyter_client/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyter/jupyter_client/issues/1145/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyter/jupyter_client/statuses/d20d0d7f9ab3b79ff328c0550cde3cbabc5b4426","number":1145,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Wake pending polls after Session.send on an asyncio socket","user":{"login":"domoritz","id":589034,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4OTAzNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/589034?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/domoritz","html_url":"https://github.com/domoritz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domoritz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domoritz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domoritz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domoritz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domoritz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domoritz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domoritz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domoritz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domoritz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"`Session.send` and `send_raw` send on a `zmq.asyncio` socket through a sync shadow. If a message is already waiting, that send can clear the edge-triggered `ZMQ_FD`, so a pending `await poll()`/`recv()` on the same socket sleeps until its timeout. This PR reads `EVENTS` through the asyncio socket after the send, which makes pyzmq wake pending futures, the same as after its own sends.\n\nThis fixes jupyter/nbclient#312: a cell with an `Output` widget can wait for the full execution timeout. The minimal repro in that issue goes from 10.8 s to 0.8 s.\n\nNew test: `test_send_wakes_pending_poll`. It fails without the fix and passes with it.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-09-29T13:12:53Z","updated_at":"2026-10-02T06:19:11Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"0ec5a1a3b9c8f0f014e374e85bec219d72878d55","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"domoritz:fix-async-send-wakeup","ref":"fix-async-send-wakeup","repo":{"id":1395346361,"node_id":"R_kgDOUytLuQ","name":"jupyter_client","full_name":"domoritz/jupyter_client","owner":{"login":"domoritz","id":589034,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4OTAzNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/589034?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/domoritz","html_url":"https://github.com/domoritz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domoritz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domoritz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domoritz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domoritz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domoritz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domoritz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domoritz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domoritz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.gi